# Ode to Joy — Sparky can sing! Notes 1-14 are two do-re-mi octaves.
# Try making your own song, or speed it up by shrinking the times.

say "🎵 Ode to Joy!"

teach note1 n
  play note n for 0.35
end

do note1 3
do note1 3
do note1 4
do note1 5
do note1 5
do note1 4
do note1 3
do note1 2
do note1 1
do note1 1
do note1 2
do note1 3
play note 3 for 0.5
play note 2 for 0.2
play note 2 for 0.7

play "tada"
say "Now write YOUR song!"
